    "pattern_name": "jwt_refresh_before_expiry",
    "description": "When users report '401 unauthorized' errors during long sessions, check if the JWT refresh mechanism is triggering before token expiration. The common fix is to refresh tokens when 80% of TTL has elapsed, not at expiration.",
